# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# WHY THESE RULES ARE CAUTIOUS. Read this before adding `immutable` back.
#
# These rules match on PATH, not on what the server actually returns. During
# a deploy the HTML can reference a hashed stylesheet seconds before that
# file exists. Cloudflare Pages then answers with its 404 page — and if the
# site has no 404.html of its own, with a generic fallback carrying a 200
# status. Either way the rule below matches the path and stamps a long life
# on a response that is not the stylesheet.
#
# On 31 Aug 2026 that put HTML in the edge cache in place of the site's CSS,
# with `immutable` telling every cache never to recheck. The live site was
# unstyled for everyone until the URL was purged by hand. Confirmed from the
# response: content-type text/html, cf-cache-status HIT, age 357.
#
# The 27 and 30 August incidents were recorded here as browsers "holding a
# bad copy". That was wrong. The server returned HTML with a 200 and the
# caches stored it, exactly as instructed.
#
# TWO THINGS KEEP IT CLOSED, and both matter:
#
#  1. src/404.njk gives Pages a real 404 to serve, so a missing asset fails
#     with a 404 status instead of looking like a success. Do not delete it.
#
#  2. `immutable` is deliberately NOT used. A year-long max-age still means
#     a browser does not re-ask, so the performance is the same; the
#     difference is that a cache holding a wrong answer can recover on a
#     reload, instead of being stuck until someone purges or clears data.
#     That is the whole difference between an annoyance and an outage.
#
# AND ONE PRACTICE: wait for the Pages build to go green before loading the
# site after a push. A single request in the deploy window, from anywhere in
# the world, is enough to fill the edge cache with the wrong answer.
#
# Long max-age is safe here only because these filenames carry a content
# hash: if the contents change, the URL changes. Never apply it to a URL
# whose contents can change under it — index.html most of all.

/assets/css/site.*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000

/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000
